{"3195940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Charming Hill", "steam_appid": 3195940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Hill is a small experimental sandbox painting game where creating beautiful paintings feels easy and natural, allowing anyone, even if just for a moment, to feel like an artist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my father's love of painting, Charming Hill began as a deeply personal project and slowly evolved into an experience about creativity, memories, and the things that stay with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience begins with a blank canvas. From there, you choose a setting to paint: gentle prairies, rugged coastlines, stone canyons, quiet lakes, or snowy mountains. Each setting offers its own unique elements, allowing endless variations on every canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no right or wrong way to paint. Every choice leads to harmonious, evocative results, making each creation feel personal and expressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a warm and emotional story as you paint, or better yet, paint your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every illustration in Charming Hill has been carefully created by human hands, with time, craft, and personal dedication. No AI-generated artwork has been used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a small team with a deeply personal approach, Charming Hill is an experimental experience meant to be enjoyed calmly and at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The painting shown below was the last one my father completed. His work, and his memory, are at the heart of Charming Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/d20b397015597f7d6e4d4afb520c300e.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=314 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Hill is a small experimental sandbox painting game where creating beautiful paintings feels easy and natural, allowing anyone, even if just for a moment, to feel like an artist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my father's love of painting, Charming Hill began as a deeply personal project and slowly evolved into an experience about creativity, memories, and the things that stay with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/ad6f8c32cfecb5d266a9dd956b0ce29f.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience begins with a blank canvas. From there, you choose a setting to paint: gentle prairies, rugged coastlines, stone canyons, quiet lakes, or snowy mountains. Each setting offers its own unique elements, allowing endless variations on every canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/4f0d4ea7263f1dcf53abf296fe43c371.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no right or wrong way to paint. Every choice leads to harmonious, evocative results, making each creation feel personal and expressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a warm and emotional story as you paint, or better yet, paint your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/a5e6daa50623dc92ec228991da89fc29.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every illustration in Charming Hill has been carefully created by human hands, with time, craft, and personal dedication. No AI-generated artwork has been used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.poster.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.webm?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/da92072818406b4751a0e60fe35e6927.mp4?t=1785940904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a small team with a deeply personal approach, Charming Hill is an experimental experience meant to be enjoyed calmly and at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The painting shown below was the last one my father completed. His work, and his memory, are at the heart of Charming Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/extras/d20b397015597f7d6e4d4afb520c300e.avif?t=1785940904\" width=616 height=314 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Charming Hill is a small experimental game where creating beautiful paintings feels easy and natural. No artistic skills are needed; it’s a space to relax, paint, and discover a heartwarming story, or better yet, paint your own.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195940/50ae5473e115eef7638834f120d0a